AddScalar GetValue after SetValue(matrix, 10) = 10.0
AddScalar 10 gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|11.0, 12.0|
|13.0, 14.0|
AddScalar GetValueMatrix after SetValue(values) gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|10.0, 20.0|
|30.0, 40.0|
AddScalar values gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|11.0, 22.0|
|33.0, 44.0|
SubtractScalar GetValue after SetValue(matrix, 1.5) = 1.5
SubtractScalar 1.5 gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|-0.5, 0.5|
|1.5, 2.5|
SubtractScalar values gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|-9.0, -18.0|
|-27.0, -36.0|
MultiplyScalar GetValue after SetValue(matrix, -2) = -2.0
MultiplyScalar -2 gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|-2.0, -4.0|
|-6.0, -8.0|
MultiplyScalar values gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|10.0, 40.0|
|90.0, 160.0|
DivideScalar GetValue after SetValue(matrix, 4) = 4.0
DivideScalar 4 gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|0.25, 0.5|
|0.75, 1.0|
DivideScalar values gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|0.1, 0.1|
|0.1, 0.1|
DivideScalar 0 gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|Infinity, Infinity|
|Infinity, Infinity|
the input matrix afterwards, which must be unchanged, gives a 2 by 2 matrix:
|1.0, 2.0|
|3.0, 4.0|
